values.content:
Based on this client information, create a comprehensive business profile. Return ONLY valid JSON:

Client Data:
Company: {{ $json.companyName }}
Industry: {{ $json.industry }}
Monthly Revenue: ${{ $json.monthlyRevenue }}
Services: {{ $json.servicesRequested }}

Return:
{
  "industry_classification": "specific industry category",
  "business_size": "micro|small|medium|large",
  "complexity_score": 1-10,
  "recommended_chart_of_accounts": [
    {"account_name": "Revenue - Product Sales", "account_number": "4001", "type": "Income"},
    {"account_name": "Cost of Goods Sold", "account_number": "5001", "type": "COGS"}
  ],
  "typical_expense_categories": ["office_rent", "utilities", "marketing", "professional_services"],
  "reporting_requirements": ["monthly_pnl", "quarterly_cash_flow", "annual_tax_prep"],
  "automation_opportunities": ["invoice_processing", "expense_tracking", "bank_reconciliation"],
  "implementation_timeline": "2-4 weeks",
  "estimated_monthly_transactions": 100,
  "priority_workflows": ["expense_automation", "invoice_processing"],
  "custom_setup_notes": "specific recommendations for this client"
}

